35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The late-turn pool is empty. Overtime covers everything. Roadway crews are a third below establishment. We cannot staff a night extension.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The late-evening pilot actually hit its cost target. But the accessibility records show lane priorities got reverted. We can’t trust the bus corridor to stick.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The minutes show ferry and rail data terms were never agreed. Roadway consents are delegated to us. The pre-war shells hide voids that stop work for weeks.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The ledger shows a ring-fenced grant, but operating funds are cut. Ticketing fees now exceed paving budgets. The headline numbers are misleading.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The audits say we lose time waiting for connections, not paying! But mid-city runs are a third slower. We’re fixing the wrong spots!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Takumi, the pilot succeeded, but my rosters show no spare hands. We cannot run it without burning out the remaining crews.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, the pilot proved the demand exists. But the accessibility records show lane priorities failed. We need a plan that doesn't rely on fragile infrastructure.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, the data terms are dead, but roadway consents are ours. @Takumi, the shells hide voids. We cannot trust any date involving pre-war structures.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Victoria, the ticketing fees are eating our budget. @Toshio, the paving rates are climbing. We can't afford the infrastructure costs if the money is already gone.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Sakura, the stopwatch proves it! We’re stuck waiting for connections, not paying. Let’s fix the real bottleneck, not the loud complaints!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, your audits point to connections, but my rosters show the crews are already stretched thin. We cannot promise new services without the people to run them.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
